      "body": "(cherry picked from commit 3a3d39c7df8a52cc67797a234347130024890008)\n\n**Manual backport notes (3.15):** the original adds `/do-not-commit/` inside main's \"Local AI agent scratch state\" block, which was never backported. 3.15 still ignores all of `/.claude/` under its older comment. This backport leaves that block alone and appends `/do-not-commit/` after it with a one-line comment. `git check-ignore` confirms the rule matches.\n",
